The MIT License below covers this repository EXCEPT for the fonts in
wezterm/fonts/, which are under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 and are not
licensed to you under the MIT terms.

  wezterm/fonts/ScienceGothicMono.ttf
  wezterm/fonts/ScienceGothicMono-Bold.ttf

They are modified versions of Science Gothic (Copyright 2024 Font Detective
LLC), generated by wezterm/mkmono.py. The full license is in
wezterm/fonts/OFL.txt and is also carried in each file's name table. The
carve-out is required rather than tidy: OFL 1.1 section 5 says the Font
Software "must be distributed entirely under this license, and must not be
distributed under any other license", so an MIT grant reaching those two files
would conflict with it. Upstream declares no Reserved Font Name, which is why
"Science Gothic Mono" is a permissible name for a modified version.

